 298:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   * @brief Enable the I2C fast mode plus driving capability.
 299:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   * @param ConfigFastModePlus Selects the pin.
 300:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   *   This parameter can be one of the @ref I2CEx_FastModePlus values
 301:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   * @note  For I2C1, fast mode plus driving capability can be enabled on all selected
 302:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   *        I2C1 pins using I2C_FASTMODEPLUS_I2C1 parameter or independently
