 305:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   *        can be enabled only by using I2C_FASTMODEPLUS_I2C1 parameter.
 306:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   * @note  For all I2C2 pins fast mode plus driving capability can be enabled
 307:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   *        only by using I2C_FASTMODEPLUS_I2C2 parameter.
 308:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   * @note  For all I2C3 pins fast mode plus driving capability can be enabled
